Package: outlook-pwa-linux
Version: 0.3.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: 420
Depends: microsoft-edge-stable, python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, pkexec
Recommends: libnotify-bin
Maintainer: afive <andershfranzen@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/andershfranzen/outlook-pwa-linux
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/andershfranzen/outlook-pwa-linux.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/andershfranzen/outlook-pwa-linux
Description: Outlook desktop integration for Linux
 Installs a desktop-integrated Outlook web application backed by Microsoft
 Edge, with isolated account profiles, a native settings app, customizable
 PWA title-bar colors, Firefox link routing, mailto handling, configurable
 downloads, notifications, verified in-app updates, and mail/calendar
 shortcuts. This is an unofficial integration package.
